  "description": "Liana Theodore was a maid who knew her place. Knowing their difference in status, she was determined to bury her love for Prince Illyd. But when Illyd awakens as a Manish with fiery powers, Liana is found to be his Aradhna--his salvation from madness and his destined other half. Can Liana conquer her new life? Or will she be ensnared in his grasp? \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
